        438.4398193359375
      ],
      "text": "Justification and evidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        445.14569091796875,
        527.4014892578125,
        459.5887145996094
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review of studies on infants and children, conducted for the 2011 guidelines provided",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        457.0697021484375,
        527.45556640625,
        472.7887268066406
      ],
      "text": "(26) limited evidence on the best approach to screening  . Using these few studies and expert opinion,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.996599197387695,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        471.54571533203125,
        527.4072875976562,
        485.9887390136719
      ],
      "text": "the previous GDG recommended a screening rule of poor weight gain, fever, current cough and a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        484.6357116699219,
        527.4144897460938,
        499.1887512207031
      ],
      "text": "recommendation 9 ). A systematic review was undertaken  history of contact with a person with TB (",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        497.9457092285156,
        527.4482421875,
        512.3887329101562
      ],
      "text": "for the 2018 update to assess the performance of the screening rule; however, the only publication",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        509.86968994140625,
        527.4129028320312,
        525.5887451171875
      ],
      "text": "(51) . In this  found was of a study of 168 children aged ≤ 12 years hospitalized with HIV in Kenya",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        524.345703125,
        527.4080810546875,
        538.7886962890625
      ],
      "text": "study, the sensitivity was 100% (95% CI, 94 ; 100.0) and the specificity was 5% (95% CI, 1 ; 11). The",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        537.5457153320312,
        527.435791015625,
        551.9887084960938
      ],
      "text": "systematic review conducted for the 2021 TB screening guidelines comprised two studies conducted",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        549.4697265625,
        527.4370727539062,
        565.188720703125
      ],
      "text": "(13) in outpatient settings, with a total of 20 926 participants  . In this review, the combined symptom",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        563.9456787109375,
        527.426513671875,
        578.388671875
      ],
      "text": "screen (in which the presence of any symptom constituted a positive screen) had a pooled sensitivity",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        577.1456909179688,
        448.5566711425781,
        591.5886840820312
      ],
      "text": "of 61% (95% CI 58% ; 64%) and a pooled specificity of 94% (95% CI 86% ; 98%) (",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        448.5794982910156,
        577.1456909179688,
        480.94482421875,
        591.5886840820312
      ],
      "text": "Table 3",
