    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        603.5457153320312,
        527.4212646484375,
        617.9887084960938
      ],
      "text": "screening was warranted for children < 10 years who were living with HIV, given the high risk of disease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.959726333618164,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        616.7457275390625,
        391.50909423828125,
        631.188720703125
      ],
      "text": "and of mortality when the diagnosis is missed and TB is left untreated.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86614990234375,
        638.4495849609375,
        527.578369140625,
        652.892578125
      ],
      "text": "Infants and children with HIV should be screened for TB as part of standard, routine clinical care,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        651.6497192382812,
        527.1504516601562,
        666.0927124023438
      ],
      "text": "regardless of whether they are receiving TPT or ART. Symptom-based screening is generally acceptable",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.996199607849121,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        664.8497314453125,
        527.4124755859375,
        679.292724609375
      ],
      "text": "to caregivers and people and is feasible even in resource-limited settings. Therefore, the GDG decided",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        678.0496826171875,
        527.2555541992188,
        692.49267578125
      ],
      "text": "to make a strong recommendation for use of symptom screening in children with HIV. TB disease should",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.981233596801758,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        691.2496948242188,
        527.37744140625,
        705.6926879882812
      ],
      "text": "be ruled out for those who have one or more symptoms. The GDG also noted that clinicians should",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        704.4495849609375,
        527.4453125,
        718.892578125
      ],
      "text": "broaden the differential diagnosis to include other diseases that may cause current cough, fever and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        717.6497192382812,
        527.414794921875,
        732.0927124023438
      ],
      "text": "poor weight gain in children with HIV. If the evaluation shows no signs of TB disease and the clinician",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        752.143798828125,
        526.5811157226562,
        763.5758056640625
      ],
      "text": "Poor weight gain  here is defined as reported weight loss, very low weight-for-age (< –3 Z-scores), underweight (weight-for-age < –2  4",
